      "activity_name": "Project planning and analysis",
      "activity_description": "Review all 8 user stories, set up local dev/test environment, sketch high-level approach for each, and produce a personal task plan. Includes familiarization with the relevant Spring XD subsystems (admin_ui, Kafka module, HDFS sink, module registration, PHD 3.0 differences).",
      "most_likely_effort": 2.0
