      "activity_name": "U7 - Module versioning: design",
      "activity_description": "Design the version model (semver) for modules, storage schema/metadata changes, side-by-side co-existence, version selection at deployment time, and integration with the upload path from U6.",
      "most_likely_effort": 2.0
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A18",
      "activity_name": "U7 - Module versioning: implementation",
      "activity_description": "Implement version-aware storage in the admin DB, update module registration/lookup APIs to accept and return versions, and add resolution logic so deployments can pin a specific version. Update U6 plugins to pass version info.",
      "most_likely_effort": 4.0
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A19",
      "activity_name": "U7 - Module versioning: testing",
      "activity_description": "Add tests for uploading multiple versions, listing/installing specific versions, and rolling upgrades without service interruption.",
      "most_likely_effort": 2.0
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A20",
      "activity_name": "U8 - PHD 3.0 environment setup and compatibility testing",
      "activity_description": "Provision a Pivotal HD 3.0 (ODP-based) Hadoop cluster, deploy Spring XD against it, and run the existing certification/compatibility test suite across HDFS sink, batch jobs, and Hadoop-related modules to identify gaps.",
